    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build. Expand. Rule the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to My Colony, the ultimate sci-fi city builder and space empire simulation. Whether you\u2019re leading a peaceful outpost or an industrial powerhouse, the galaxy is yours to shape \u2014 one rover at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Colony</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a single lander and rover, gather resources, and unlock a massive tech tree full of structures, utilities, and special units. Every resource leads to new possibilities as you evolve from a basic outpost to a sprawling interplanetary empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of four distinct factions, each with unique tech trees, units, and play styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">United Earth \u2013 Balanced and tech-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">League of Independent States \u2013 Resource-efficient rebels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zolarg Empire \u2013 Insectoid swarm-style economics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Draconians \u2013 Advanced reptilian overlords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-city sandbox or Premium Region Mode with connected cities across a shared map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer Regions: Cooperate or compete with friends \u2014 each sub-city run by a different player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Declare independence from your \u201cmother colony\u201d and start your own empire \u2014 with players paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build. Expand. Rule the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to My Colony, the ultimate sci-fi city builder and space empire simulation. Whether you\u2019re leading a peaceful outpost or an industrial powerhouse, the galaxy is yours to shape \u2014 one rover at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Colony</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a single lander and rover, gather resources, and unlock a massive tech tree full of structures, utilities, and special units. Every resource leads to new possibilities as you evolve from a basic outpost to a sprawling interplanetary empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of four distinct factions, each with unique tech trees, units, and play styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">United Earth \u2013 Balanced and tech-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">League of Independent States \u2013 Resource-efficient rebels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zolarg Empire \u2013 Insectoid swarm-style economics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Draconians \u2013 Advanced reptilian overlords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-city sandbox or Premium Region Mode with connected cities across a shared map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer Regions: Cooperate or compete with friends \u2014 each sub-city run by a different player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Declare independence from your \u201cmother colony\u201d and start your own empire \u2014 with players paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build, expand, and rule a growing space colony. Explore tech, trade, and multiplayer.",
